              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“None of you shall approach any one near of kin to him to uncover nakedness. I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father, which is the nakedness of your mother; she is your mother, you shall not uncover her nakedness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father's wife; it is your father's nakedness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 27.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall not uncover the nakedness of your sister, the daughter of your father or the daughter of your mother, whether born at home or born abroad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall not uncover the nakedness of your son's daughter or of your daughter's daughter, for their nakedness is your own nakedness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father's wife's daughter, begotten by your father, since she is your sister. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father's sister; she is your father's near kinswoman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall not uncover the nakedness of your mother's sister, for she is your mother's near kinswoman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall not uncover the nakedness of your father's brother, that is, you shall not approach his wife; she is your aunt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall not uncover the nakedness of your daughter-in-law; she is your son's wife, you shall not uncover her nakedness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 20.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall not uncover the nakedness of your brother's wife; she is your brother's nakedness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
