                "loc": "DEU.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 27.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And you shall not lie with any beast and defile yourself with it, neither shall any woman give herself to a beast to lie with it: it is perversion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Do not defile yourselves by any of these things, for by all these the nations I am casting out before you defiled themselves; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the land became defiled, so that I punished its iniquity, and the land vomited out its inhabitants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you shall keep my statutes and my ordinances and do none of these abominations, either the native or the stranger who sojourns among you ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(for all of these abominations the men of the land did, who were before you, so that the land became defiled); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lest the land vomit you out, when you defile it, as it vomited out the nation that was before you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For whoever shall do any of these abominations, the persons that do them shall be cut off from among their people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So keep my charge never to practice any of these abominable customs which were practiced before you, and never to defile yourselves by them: I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
